_QJXiUCE6c2vaIkJ38P8z8EI5rlURGBKpfYtGuCshSqgBlrygXdAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyQj4LlbE1ODlSLnMYPvi0bHF7w-8Uv--t6fy6sDZMsnQ&oe=69BD372E"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175727.png", "id": "1630611974467428", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411988_1630611977800761_7635821973011666471_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fOTHiHyTSVkQ7kNvwHZ-xQ3&_nc_oc=Admhu0VuDGPIBlydzFJdSQF99lzsLcnVRDfHsABdPDCw2jCmMwlKYuudLxC51LCn1Js&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyx3qWs9RUiMO0KHHhk0EX83WX-IvtPrYs5uGVmzaz2NA&oe=69BD60EE"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175713.png", "id": "549067324527740", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210389_549067327861073_2529266429934636058_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DUGrBmy0UqUQ7kNvwEdG3su&_nc_oc=AdmxvD1g6H-Gi6OYq9_A5aDO2z6vEom0vTDsjYAyGWvrvwAbdzX34JiHcVWWf48n0vU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwsRn7Oe2oXYaLM56suKwtYV25QCiKypBdk46p1Tx9DRA&oe=69BD447B"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175750.png", "id": "1233285141120740", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974456_1233285144454073_4577451540501517425_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bACY8CSaTyMQ7kNvwHrK8AJ&_nc_oc=Adl0plB7Q21Ow56enXVd_4dxiIJBsq-GUuQaJKHCL7CtK42VCCysXpyjw686VzxLOqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy3LSvybFXMYMh4kjHkszFW9O6YXK-QixdEmBX9lBap0g&oe=69BD4A0F"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175810 (1).png", "id": "1549630812590254", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984460_1549630815923587_3757692530628789073_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mIRxyGgEnKYQ7kNvwGG6eiR&_nc_oc=AdlrD9L9UxhzvdN2e3FuJcu0QaEbJQB0GoKjSH52Rs4q0iiKe8Yi0XrF4Lvjru-jYl0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy1i7Zm8C9IT-Jc-LDbWQ7zt8VdKpbq_OkGB2T3pWhg4g&oe=69BD4223"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wells Taggers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer runs out. Runners must avoid being tagged and use the environment and power-ups to outmaneuver the Taggers.\n\nGame Modes:\n\nClassic Tag: Traditional tag mode where Taggers must tag all Runners to win.\nInfected Tag: Tagged players become Taggers, spreading the infection until only one Runner remains.\nFreeze Tag: Tagged players are frozen in place until a teammate unfreezes them. Taggers win by freezing all players.\nMaps:\n\nUrban Playground: Navigate through a bustling cityscape with rooftops, alleys, and parks.\nEnchanted Forest: A magical forest filled with hiding spots and mystical creatures.\nSpace Station: A futuristic environment with zero-gravity zones and space-themed obstacles.\nPower-Ups:\n\n\n", "short_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer."}]}, "developer_name": "Wells_VR", "developer_privacy_policy_ur